{"authored" [{"question" "q-12708" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate the integral $\\int ({log}_{3}⁡x)^{2}\\,\\text{d}x.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012723/state.json" "file_sha256" "b5ffccc056d43c528012bcb9c43d0684d0799657c1a2679280b6a6fed57beb94" "basis" 1160 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012723/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-12708" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "We need to use integration by parts.\n\nIn this case, we define\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u=({log}_{3}⁡x)^{2}\\, & ⟹\\,\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{2{log}_{3}⁡x}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡3} \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=1\\, & ⟹\\,v=\\int \\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x=\\int \\,\\text{d}x=x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the formula of integration by parts, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ({log}_{3}⁡x)^{2}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int u\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =uv-\\int v\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={({log}_{3}⁡x)}^{2}(x)-\\int (x)(\\frac{2{log}_{3}⁡x}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡3})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =x{({log}_{3}⁡x)}^{2}-\\frac{2}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}\\int {log}_{3}⁡(x)\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe use integration by parts once again to evaluate  $\\int {log}_{3}⁡(x)\\,\\text{d}x.$ We take\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u={log}_{3}⁡(x)\\, & ⟹\\,\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡3} \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=1\\, & ⟹\\,v=\\int \\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x=\\int \\,\\text{d}x=x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIn this case, the formula for integration by parts gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int {log}_{3}⁡(x)\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int u\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =uv-\\int v\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =({log}_{3}⁡(x))(x)-\\int (x)(\\frac{1}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡3})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =x{log}_{3}⁡(x)-\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}\\int \\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =x{log}_{3}⁡(x)-\\frac{x}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}+D,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $D$ is an integral constant.\n\nSo we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ({log}_{3}⁡x)^{2}\\,\\text{d}x & =x{({log}_{3}⁡x)}^{2}-\\frac{2}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}(x{log}_{3}⁡(x)-\\frac{x}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}+D) \\\\  & =x{({log}_{3}⁡x)}^{2}-\\frac{2x{log}_{3}⁡(x)}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}+\\frac{2x}{{ln}^{2}⁡3}-\\frac{2D}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3} \\\\  & =x({({log}_{3}⁡x)}^{2}-\\frac{2{log}_{3}⁡(x)}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}+\\frac{2}{{ln}^{2}⁡3})+C,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $C=-\\frac{2D}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012723/state.json" "file_sha256" "b5ffccc056d43c528012bcb9c43d0684d0799657c1a2679280b6a6fed57beb94" "basis" 1160 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012723/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-12708" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012723/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "73e2e5d6ad4967d7751ef0e1dbef63ab5f4bc0743b1a19fe41d4aaf281d1bc56" "basis" 1160 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012723/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-12708" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012723/state.json" "file_sha256" "b5ffccc056d43c528012bcb9c43d0684d0799657c1a2679280b6a6fed57beb94" "basis" 1160 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012723/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-12